---
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<title>Claws - Untamed Weapons</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<nav class="nav">
			<div class="container">
				<a href="/" class="logo">UNTAMED</a>
				<div class="nav-links">
					<a href="/rules">Rules</a>
					<a href="/quick-reference">Quick Reference</a>
					<a href="/character">Characters</a>
					<a href="/bestiary">Bestiary</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<main>
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb">
					<a href="/character">← Back to Character Creation</a>
				</div>

				<header class="page-header">
					<div class="weapon-icon"><img src="/weapons/Claw.png" alt="Claws" /></div>
					<h1>Claws</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">Speed / Aggression</p>
					<div class="stat-badges">
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 DEX</span>
						<span class="stat-badge">+1 INS</span>
					</div>
				</header>

				<article class="content">
					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Overview</h2>
						<p>The Claws are close-combat weapons designed for relentless pressure, high mobility, and vicious flurries of attacks. Hunters who wield Claws become blur-fast predators, darting through openings and shredding enemies before slipping out of reach. Though they deal lower per-hit damage than heavy weapons, they excel at exploiting weakness, staggering foes, and chaining effects — every landed hit is an invitation to land another.</p>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Weapon Attributes</h2>
						<div class="attributes-grid">
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Tags</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Light</li>
									<li>Two-Handed (light)</li>
									<li>Parry</li>
									<li>Mobile</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Save DC</h3>
								<p class="formula">10 + DEX mod + proficiency</p>
							</div>
							<div class="attribute-card">
								<h3>Basic Swipe</h3>
								<p><strong>1 Stamina:</strong> d20 + DEX + proficiency vs AR → weapon damage on hit.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section highlight">
						<h2>Core Mechanic — Predatory Chain</h2>
						<p>You turn one opening into many. A single landed hit cascades into a flurry — each link feeding the next.</p>
						<div class="mechanic-details">
							<h3>Chain Rules</h3>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Trigger:</strong> When a Claw attack you make hits (Basic Swipe or a Technique that rolls to hit).</li>
								<li><strong>Link 1:</strong> Immediately make one Follow-up Swipe as a <strong>Fast Action (1 Stamina)</strong>.</li>
								<li><strong>Link 2:</strong> If Link 1 hits, you may make one more Follow-up Swipe as a <strong>Reaction (1 Stamina)</strong>.</li>
								<li><strong>Chain ends</strong> if any link misses, you Dodge or Parry, or after 2 follow-ups.</li>
								<li><strong>Max 2 follow-ups per chain.</strong> Follow-ups are Basic Swipes — they can crit, break parts, and apply riders normally.</li>
							</ul>
							<p style="margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0;"><em>Note: spending your Reaction on Link 2 means you can't Parry that round. That tension is intentional.</em></p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Damage Dice per Tier</h2>
						<table class="damage-table">
							<thead>
								<tr>
									<th>Tier</th>
									<th>Damage Dice</th>
								</tr>
							</thead>
							<tbody>
								<tr><td>Tier 1</td><td>1d6 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 2</td><td>1d8 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 3</td><td>2d6 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 4</td><td>2d8 + DEX</td></tr>
								<tr><td>Tier 5</td><td>3d6 + DEX</td></tr>
							</tbody>
						</table>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section">
						<h2>Techniques by Tier</h2>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T1 — Rend</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>Dual raking cross-slashes that open wounds and keep the chain alive.</p>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Make <strong>two Claw attacks</strong> against the same target.</p>
							<ul>
								<li>If <strong>both hit:</strong> apply <strong>Bleeding</strong> (target takes 1d4 damage at the end of its turn until treated or staunched).</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Chain:</strong> Each hit can start or advance your Predatory Chain normally. Rend's two swings don't count as the chain's follow-up links — if the last Rend hit connects, you can still take up to 2 follow-ups afterward.</p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T2 — Leap Pounce</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">2 Stamina • Action</div>
							</div>
							<p>Explosive entry that puts you on top of your target and immediately starts your flow.</p>
							<p><strong>Leap:</strong> Move up to <strong>15 ft</strong> toward a visible target. This movement ignores opportunity attacks.</p>
							<p><strong>Strike:</strong> Make one Claw attack with <strong>advantage</strong>. On hit:</p>
							<ul>
								<li>Deal normal Claw damage.</li>
								<li>Target makes a <strong>DEX save vs your Claw DC</strong> or is knocked <strong>Prone</strong>.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>Chain:</strong> On a hit, immediately start Predatory Chain.</p>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T3 — Predator's Tempo</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive</div>
							</div>
							<p>Your finishing rhythm clicks. Completing the full chain unlocks a free execution strike.</p>
							<p>If you land <strong>both chain follow-ups</strong> (Link 1 and Link 2) in the same turn, you may make <strong>Eviscerate</strong> as a <strong>Free Action</strong> once per turn:</p>
							<ul>
								<li>Deal <strong>+1 Power Die</strong> (one extra weapon damage die) to the last hit target.</li>
								<li>No additional attack roll — this is bonus damage applied to the final chain hit.</li>
								<li>Ends the chain.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T4 — Blood Rush</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">Passive</div>
							</div>
							<p>Your chain becomes fluid — you flow through it, sustain it, and bleed your target dry.</p>
							<ul>
								<li><strong>Flow Step:</strong> During a chain, you may reposition up to <strong>5 ft between each hit</strong>. This movement does not provoke opportunity attacks.</li>
								<li><strong>First Blood:</strong> The first Claw hit each of your turns applies <strong>+1 Bleed stack</strong> (increases existing Bleeding by one die; doesn't stack with Rend's initial application on the same hit).</li>
								<li><strong>Miss Cushion (1/turn):</strong> If a chain link misses, you may spend <strong>1 Stamina</strong> to keep the chain going. The miss still deals no damage — this simply prevents the chain from ending.</li>
							</ul>
						</div>

						<div class="technique-card">
							<div class="technique-header">
								<h3>T5 — Apex Blitz</h3>
								<div class="technique-cost">3 Stamina • Action • Once per turn</div>
							</div>
							<p>A whirling execution of speed and precision — then the chain begins again.</p>
							<p><strong>Effect:</strong> Make <strong>three Claw attacks</strong> against one target. The 3 Stamina entry fee covers all three — no additional cost per swing. Each attack is resolved separately.</p>
							<ul>
								<li>On each hit: add <strong>+1 Power Die</strong> to that hit's damage.</li>
							</ul>
							<p><strong>After Blitz:</strong> If any of the three attacks connected, you may immediately trigger <strong>Predatory Chain</strong> (up to 2 follow-up links as normal).</p>
						</div>
					</section>

					<section class="weapon-section playstyle">
						<h2>Weapon Playstyle</h2>
						<div class="playstyle-grid">
							<div class="playstyle-card strengths">
								<h3>Strengths</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Chain system means every hit is immediately rewarded with another chance to hit</li>
									<li>High mobility — Flow Step and Leap Pounce keep you in the monster's blind spots</li>
									<li>Bleeding stacks compound over a long fight, punishing anything that doesn't end quickly</li>
									<li>Parry tag gives a defensive out that most fast weapons don't have</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
							<div class="playstyle-card weaknesses">
								<h3>Weaknesses</h3>
								<ul>
									<li>Low per-hit damage — reward requires connecting multiple links</li>
									<li>Stamina-hungry when chaining: full chain costs 3 STA per turn minimum</li>
									<li>Using Reaction on Link 2 means no Parry that round — you're committed</li>
									<li>Heavily positioning-dependent; forced movement or knockback breaks flow</li>
								</ul>
							</div>
						</div>
					</section>
				</article>
			</div>
		</main>

		<style>
			* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
			:root {
				--forest-dark: #1a2e1a; --forest-green: #2d5016; --moss-green: #4a7c2f;
				--leaf-green: #6b9d3a; --amber: #d4a257; --earth-brown: #5c4033;
				--cream: #f5f1e8; --text-light: #e8e4d8;
			}
			body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: var(--forest-dark); color: var(--text-light); line-height: 1.7; min-height: 100vh; }
			.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 2rem; }
			.nav { background: var(--forest-green); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); padding: 1rem 0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
			.nav .container { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; }
			.logo { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900; color: var(--amber); text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.2rem; }
			.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
			.nav-links a { color: var(--cream); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.3s; }
			.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.breadcrumb { padding: 2rem 0 1rem; }
			.breadcrumb a { color: var(--leaf-green); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
			.breadcrumb a:hover { color: var(--amber); }
			.page-header { padding: 2rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
			.weapon-icon { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-icon img { width: 540px; height: 540px; object-fit: contain; }
			.page-header h1 { font-size: 3rem; color: var(--amber); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.subtitle { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--leaf-green); font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.stat-badges { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1rem; }
			.stat-badge { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1rem; }
			.content { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
			.weapon-section { background: var(--forest-green); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 2rem; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.weapon-section.highlight { border-color: var(--amber); background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--forest-green) 0%, var(--moss-green) 100%); }
			.weapon-section h2 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.weapon-section h3 { color: var(--leaf-green); font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem; }
			.weapon-section p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.weapon-section li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attributes-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.attribute-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.attribute-card h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
			.attribute-card p { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.attribute-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
			.attribute-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			.formula { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--amber); font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-weight: 600; color: var(--amber); text-align: center; }
			.mechanic-details { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 1rem; }
			.damage-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--forest-dark); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; }
			.damage-table th, .damage-table td { padding: 1rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.damage-table th { background: var(--moss-green); color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; }
			.damage-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
			.technique-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--amber); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
			.technique-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.technique-header h3 { color: var(--amber); font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0; }
			.technique-cost { background: var(--moss-green); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--amber); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem; }
			.playstyle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; }
			.playstyle-card { background: var(--forest-dark); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 2px solid var(--earth-brown); }
			.playstyle-card.strengths { border-color: var(--leaf-green); }
			.playstyle-card.weaknesses { border-color: #c74440; }
			.playstyle-card h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--amber); }
			.playstyle-card ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; }
			.playstyle-card li { padding-left: 1.5rem; position: relative; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
			.playstyle-card li:before { content: "▸"; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--amber); }
			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.nav .container { flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
				.nav-links { gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
				.page-header h1 { font-size: 2rem; }
				.weapon-section { padding: 1.5rem; }
				.technique-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 1rem; }
			}
			html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
